WEBVTT

00:07:58.375 --> 00:08:01.893
Watu paza sauti

00:08:01.917 --> 00:08:06.476
(Watu wanashangilia)

00:08:06.500 --> 00:08:12.893
(Makofi)

00:08:12.917 --> 00:08:15.976
Nyimbo inayofuata ina Kiswahili ndani yake,

00:08:16.000 --> 00:08:18.518
ambayo ndiyo lugha tunaongea nchini Kenya.

00:08:18.542 --> 00:08:21.893
Na unahusu urafiki wa wanawake

00:08:21.917 --> 00:08:23.434
na nguvu ya mwanamke

00:08:23.458 --> 00:08:26.684
Na wasichana wanaungana pamoja kutengeneza kitu ambacho kitadumu,

00:08:26.708 --> 00:08:29.934
urithi halisi na uthamani wa kizazi mchanganyiko.

00:08:29.958 --> 00:08:31.250
"Suzie Noma."